WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.243
Day 8. A Sentence About a Picture.

2
00:00:02.693 --> 00:00:09.705
Watch first. The first one on the page is written for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:10.205 --> 00:00:15.932
Today the idea is your child's own. Look at the picture. Your child says a sentence about it.

4
00:00:16.382 --> 00:00:20.118
Count the words on your fingers. Draw one short line for each word.

5
00:00:20.568 --> 00:00:23.257
Your child writes it on the lines and reads it back.
